  reservations as nonlocal only when the remaining clause is an explicit
  computation with no local applicability condition.
- Keep distinct complete-source test witnesses when the same reached formula leaf uses different source-grounded temporal parameter values.
- Ground standalone textual fractions across line breaks before numeric grounding validation.
- Repair generated conditional formulas that use `then:` syntax instead of RuleSpec expression syntax.
- Classify historical Tennessee SNAP table outputs as outside PolicyEngine oracle coverage.
- Fill generated companion-test defaults for missing inputs of transitive imported RuleSpec dependencies during apply validation.
- Allow the protected signing runtime to perform the exact ignored-file status check required before replacing a legacy RuleSpec module.
- Allow legacy RuleSpec replacement to enumerate exact staged file modes through the protected signing runtime.
- Allow the signing runtime's trusted Git broker to perform the exact base-blob,
